WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:09.400
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE ALREADY SEEN A BLACK

00:00:09.401 --> 00:00:10.701
PRESIDENT AND FIRST FAMILY.

00:00:10.702 --> 00:00:13.571
NOW WE WANT TO KNOW WHAT IT IS

00:00:13.572 --> 00:00:14.438
GOING TO MEAN.

00:00:14.439 --> 00:00:16.173
SYMBOLISM IS NOT ENOUGH NOW.

00:00:16.174 --> 00:00:16.807
IT IS SUBSTANCE.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:19.944
AND IF THERE IS NO SUBSTANCE,

00:00:19.945 --> 00:00:21.913
THEN WE'VE GOTTEN OVER THE ARIA

00:00:21.914 --> 00:00:23.314
OF THE FIRST.

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:24.482
&gt;&gt; Laura: THOSE COMMENTS ALONG

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:27.318
WITH OTHERS AT THE NATIONAL

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:28.753
ACTION NETWORK WERE DRIPPING

00:00:28.754 --> 00:00:29.220
WITH GRIEVANCE.

00:00:29.221 --> 00:00:30.588
THEY LED ME TO POSE THIS

00:00:30.589 --> 00:00:32.990
QUESTION YESTERDAY.

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.426
TODAY IS ANNIVERSARY OF THE

00:00:35.427 --> 00:00:36.994
ASSASSINATION OF THE REVEREND

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.129
MARTIN LUTHER KING JUNIOR.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.897
I WAS THINKING IF HE WERE ALIVE

00:00:39.898 --> 00:00:42.900
TODAY, I WONDER WHAT HE WOULD

00:00:42.901 --> 00:00:44.535
THINK ABOUT SUCH DISMISSIVE

00:00:44.536 --> 00:00:44.902
COMMENTS?

00:00:44.903 --> 00:00:47.438
AND ABOUT A DEMOCRAT PARTY THAT

00:00:47.439 --> 00:00:49.307
BELIEVES IT CAN REGAIN POWER BY

00:00:49.308 --> 00:00:52.577
LIVING IN A CONSTANT STATE OF

00:00:52.578 --> 00:00:56.147
PROTEST OR RACIAL HATRED AND

00:00:56.148 --> 00:00:56.614
DENIAL?

00:00:56.615 --> 00:00:57.915
FOR HIGHLIGHTING HOW THE

00:00:57.916 --> 00:01:00.651
MANUFACTURED OUTRAGE BY SOME OF

00:01:00.652 --> 00:01:03.187
THE SOCIAL JUSTICE WARRIORS IS

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.355
CREATING RACIAL DIVISION AND

00:01:04.356 --> 00:01:04.689
HATRED.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.257
I WAS ATTACKED JUST ASKING A

00:01:06.258 --> 00:01:06.624
QUESTION.

00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:13.931
KIND OF IN THE RESPONSE TO

00:01:13.932 --> 00:01:14.999
PROVING MY POINT.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.169
THEY AREN'T INTERESTED IN THE

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:19.870
STATE OF -- CRIMINAL JUSTICE

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:22.673
REFORM, SCHOOL CHOICE, ALL THE

00:01:22.674 --> 00:01:24.308
THINGS THAT CONSERVATIVES LOVE.

00:01:24.309 --> 00:01:27.411
INSTEAD THEY ATTEMPT TO

00:01:27.412 --> 00:01:28.312
DEMONIZE ANYONE WHO REJECTS

00:01:28.313 --> 00:01:29.246
DIVISIVE, NEGATIVE WAY OF

00:01:29.247 --> 00:01:29.614
THINKING.

00:01:29.615 --> 00:01:31.148
THEY WANT TO SHUT DOWN SPEECH.

00:01:31.149 --> 00:01:32.550
THEY DON'T BELIEVE IN OPEN

00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:32.917
DIALOGUE.

00:01:32.918 --> 00:01:37.088
JOINING ME NOW IS A WOMAN WHO

00:01:37.089 --> 00:01:37.955
DOES, ALVEDA KING, NIECE OF

00:01:37.956 --> 00:01:38.990
MARTIN LUTHER KING, JUNIOR.

00:01:38.991 --> 00:01:40.825
HAS THE TYPE OF STUFF YOU'RE

00:01:40.826 --> 00:01:42.693
SEEING FROM JESSE JACKSON AND

00:01:42.694 --> 00:01:44.095
ALL THE DEMOCRATS, ONE AFTER

00:01:44.096 --> 00:01:46.263
THE OTHER AFTER THE OTHER

00:01:46.264 --> 00:01:48.799
BOWING DOWN TO HIS IDENTITY

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.701
OVER THE LAST FEW DAYS, I JUST

00:01:50.702 --> 00:01:53.871
RAISE THE QUESTION BECAUSE IT

00:01:53.872 --> 00:01:54.905
IS SO NEGATIVE.

00:01:54.906 --> 00:01:56.774
EVEN OBAMA'S PRESIDENCY WAS

00:01:56.775 --> 00:01:57.708
DISMISSED BY AL SHARPTON SAYING

00:01:57.709 --> 00:01:59.343
HE DID GOOD THINGS BUT NOW IT'S

00:01:59.344 --> 00:02:00.745
ON TO THE REAL WORK.

00:02:00.746 --> 00:02:02.513
&gt;&gt; ISN'T THAT AMAZING THAT AL

00:02:02.514 --> 00:02:04.281
SHARPTON WOULD SAY THAT?

00:02:04.282 --> 00:02:06.517
HE FORGETS MANY THINGS QUICKLY.

00:02:06.518 --> 00:02:08.252
I THINK HE FORGOT MARTIN LUTHER

00:02:08.253 --> 00:02:10.521
KING, JUNIOR WAS A PROPHET.

00:02:10.522 --> 00:02:12.456
JESSE JACKSON FORGOT THAT, TOO.

00:02:12.457 --> 00:02:14.692
IN THE SPIRIT OF JESUS CHRIST

00:02:14.693 --> 00:02:16.594
IT SOUNDS LIKE SOCIALISM TO SAY

00:02:16.595 --> 00:02:18.496
FEED THE POOR AND TAKE CARE OF

00:02:18.497 --> 00:02:23.668
THE HUNGRY.

00:02:23.669 --> 00:02:25.336
THAT'S THE PERSPECTIVE OF

00:02:25.337 --> 00:02:27.972
MARTIN LUTHER KING.

00:02:27.973 --> 00:02:29.674
&gt;&gt; Laura: SOME OF YOUR

00:02:29.675 --> 00:02:30.841
RELATIVES WERE TWEETING ABOUT

00:02:30.842 --> 00:02:31.142
THIS.

00:02:31.143 --> 00:02:34.111
YOU NEVER KNOW WHAT ANYONE

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:35.246
WOULD THINK.

00:02:35.247 --> 00:02:37.448
WHAT WOULD THOMAS JEFFERSON

00:02:37.449 --> 00:02:37.748
THINK?

00:02:37.749 --> 00:02:39.483
I WAS WATCHING A LOT OF HIS

00:02:39.484 --> 00:02:40.751
SPEECHES BEFORE THE SHOW AND

00:02:40.752 --> 00:02:45.089
GOING BACK AND WATCHING.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:48.693
HE WAS SOUNDING MORE FAVORABLE

00:02:48.694 --> 00:02:49.994
TO SOCIALISM AND THEIR IDEAS.

00:02:49.995 --> 00:02:51.295
ONE OF HIS SPEECHES WE HAVE THE

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:54.098
FULL SCREEN WHEN HE TALKED

00:02:54.099 --> 00:02:55.032
ABOUT SOCIALISM.

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:57.835
THIS IS A DESCRIPTION OF HIM.

00:02:57.836 --> 00:02:59.970
DR. KING WAS ANTI-WAR,

00:02:59.971 --> 00:03:02.606
ANTI-CAPITALISM AND PRO

00:03:02.607 --> 00:03:02.973
SOCIALISM.

00:03:02.974 --> 00:03:06.110
HE SAW CAPITALISM AN ECONOMIC

00:03:06.111 --> 00:03:09.480
STRUCTURE THAT BREAD POVERTY

00:03:09.481 --> 00:03:10.548
AND INJUSTICE AND CHANGE

00:03:10.549 --> 00:03:12.516
SOCIETY INTO A DEMOCRATIC FORM

00:03:12.517 --> 00:03:13.918
OF SOCIALISM WHICH THE WORKERS

00:03:13.919 --> 00:03:20.057
OWN AND DIRECT PROFIT IN WHICH

00:03:20.058 --> 00:03:22.893
THEY WORKED AND PRODUCED AN

00:03:22.894 --> 00:03:24.228
EXTREMELY WEALTHY UPPER CLASS

00:03:24.229 --> 00:03:27.732
BUT LEFT OTHERS IN DIRE POVERTY.

00:03:27.733 --> 00:03:29.133
HIS ACTUAL SPEECHES FROM KING

00:03:29.134 --> 00:03:33.437
WHERE HE DISCUSSED THE NEED TO

00:03:33.438 --> 00:03:34.138
FUNDAMENTALLY RESTRUCTURE THE

00:03:34.139 --> 00:03:36.307
ECONOMIC SYSTEM IN THE UNITED

00:03:36.308 --> 00:03:36.774
STATES.

00:03:36.775 --> 00:03:39.043
SO MAYBE THE PUSH TOWARD

00:03:39.044 --> 00:03:41.445
SOCIALISM IS IN THE TRADITION

00:03:41.446 --> 00:03:43.848
OF HIM?

00:03:43.849 --> 00:03:46.317
&gt;&gt; NOT EXACTLY SOCIALISM.

00:03:46.318 --> 00:03:49.253
HE WOULD WANT TO SEE

00:03:49.254 --> 00:03:50.888
AFRICAN-AMERICANS TODAY OWN

00:03:50.889 --> 00:03:52.923
LAND, OWN PROPERTY, WORK,

00:03:52.924 --> 00:03:53.758
CONTRIBUTE TO SOCIETY.

00:03:53.759 --> 00:03:57.027
SO HE WOULD NOT NECESSARILY

00:03:57.028 --> 00:03:58.929
HAVE SUPPORTED JUST HAND-OUTS

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:00.564
WITHOUT HAND UP AND EQUIPPING

00:04:00.565 --> 00:04:01.499
PEOPLE TO FISH FOREVER RATHER

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.535
THAN HAVING A FISH FOR A DAY.

00:04:04.536 --> 00:04:05.703
HIS SOCIALISM WAS MORE

00:04:05.704 --> 00:04:07.805
REMINDFUL OF CHRIST RATHER THAN

00:04:07.806 --> 00:04:09.440
A POLITICAL STRUCTURE OR SYSTEM.

00:04:09.441 --> 00:04:13.811
BUT AS FAR AS PERPETUAL

00:04:13.812 --> 00:04:15.479
PROTEST, HE WAS SEWING SEEDS OF

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:15.780
HOPE.

00:04:15.781 --> 00:04:17.848
ONE DAY THIS WILL END AND WE'LL

00:04:17.849 --> 00:04:21.318
ALL HAVE SOMETHING TOGETHER.

00:04:21.319 --> 00:04:22.119
THAT'S THE MARTIN LUTHER KING

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.154
JUNIOR THAT I KNOW.

00:04:23.155 --> 00:04:24.889
&gt;&gt; Laura: HE WAS WORKING WITH

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:28.793
PEOPLE IN BOTH PARTIES.

00:04:28.794 --> 00:04:30.795
THE CIVIL RIGHTS MOVEMENT TODAY

00:04:30.796 --> 00:04:31.629
IT -- YOU DON'T

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:34.465
&gt;&gt; IT HAS TO BE EITHER/OR.

00:04:34.466 --> 00:04:35.733
IF YOU'RE AN AFRICAN-AMERICAN

00:04:35.734 --> 00:04:37.635
EVERYBODY INSISTS YOU NEED TO

00:04:37.636 --> 00:04:39.670
BE A DEMOCRAT AND MARTIN LUTHER

00:04:39.671 --> 00:04:42.740
KING JUNIOR WAS AN INDEPENDENT.

00:04:42.741 --> 00:04:45.576
HIS DAD STARTED OUT AS A

00:04:45.577 --> 00:04:47.144
REPUBLICAN.

00:04:47.145 --> 00:04:50.047
HE WAS AN INDEPENDENT.

00:04:50.048 --> 00:04:51.215
WHY SHARPTON FORGETS.

00:04:51.216 --> 00:04:54.318
IF WE FORGET OUR HISTORY WE'LL

00:04:54.319 --> 00:04:57.087
FORGET THE BAD PART AND FORGET

00:04:57.088 --> 00:04:58.556
TO DO THE GOOD LIFE OVER AGAIN.

00:04:58.557 --> 00:05:00.324
&gt;&gt; Laura: YOU DO SO MUCH GREAT

00:05:00.325 --> 00:05:04.028
WORK FOR THE PRO-LIFE COMMUNITY.

00:05:04.029 --> 00:05:05.663
&gt;&gt; CIVIL RIGHTS FOR THE UNBORN.

00:05:05.664 --> 00:05:07.298
I'M GLAD TO SEE MORE AND MORE

00:05:07.299 --> 00:05:08.499
BEING DONE.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.802
WE NEED TO END RACISM, ABORTION

00:05:11.803 --> 00:05:12.736
AND INFANTICIDE FROM MY

00:05:12.737 --> 00:05:13.637
PERSPECTIVE.

00:05:13.638 --> 00:05:17.208
&gt;&gt; Laura: THAT'S SOMETHING THAT

00:05:17.209 --> 00:05:21.412
YOU CALL HIM DADDY KING IN HIS

00:05:21.413 --> 00:05:22.346
CORE.

00:05:22.347 --> 00:05:23.981
&gt;&gt; HE WAS ALWAYS PRO-LIFE FROM

00:05:23.982 --> 00:05:27.552
BIRTH UNTIL WHEN HE LEFT THE

